    basicConversation:
    - id: 1
      conversation: 'You seem like a freshman, what class are you in? I''ll give you a weapon for your class. Tell me the class you are in. This weapon is also available for Extreme class. But make sure that it is given to only new students who reach level 10. Come to me every time you reach the level of 30, 50 and 70. I''ll exchange your armor to the better one then. '
